# go2rtc 二进制文件目录
# 
# 构建前需要将各平台的 go2rtc 二进制放到此目录:
#
# Linux:
#   go2rtc-linux-amd64
#   go2rtc-linux-arm64
#   go2rtc-linux-riscv64
#
# Windows:
#   go2rtc-windows-amd64.exe
#
# macOS:
#   go2rtc-darwin-amd64
#   go2rtc-darwin-arm64
#
# 获取方式:
# 1. 从 https://github.com/AlexxIT/go2rtc/releases 下载
# 2. 或从已编译的版本复制:
#    - RISC-V: rivision-k3-deploy/rel/rivision_server/thirdparty/go2rtc/go2rtc
